CustomScenarioConfig.description:
Complete configuration for a voice bot scenario.

This is the FULL structure the scenario generator must produce.
Output ONLY raw JSON - no markdown code blocks, no explanatory text.

COMPLETE OUTPUT EXAMPLE:
```json
{
  "config": {
    "data_extraction_settings": {
      "type": "enabled",
      "json_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Customer Feedback",
        "description": "Data collected from customer feedback call",
        "required": ["satisfaction_rating"],
        "properties": {
          "satisfaction_rating": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Satisfaction Rating",
            "description": "Customer satisfaction from 1-5",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 5
          },
          "preferred_contact_method": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Preferred Contact Method",
            "enum": ["phone", "email", "whatsapp", "sms"]
          }
        }
      },
      "advanced_settings": {"additional_sinks": []}
    },
    "for_language_settings": [
      {
        "back_channeling": {
          "type": "word",
          "value": 0.6,
          "whitelist": ["تمام", "حاضر", "ممتاز", "زين", "نعم"]
        },
        "default": true,
        "first_message": "السلام عليكم، معك نور من {{company_name}}. كيف حالك؟",
        "language_settings": {"language": "ar"},
        "prompt": "[Business-focused prompt with sections and hardcoded messages]",
        "removed": false,
        "timeout_settings": {"duration": 15, "max_retries": 5, "type": "enabled"},
        "voice": null
      },
      {
        "back_channeling": {
          "type": "word",
          "value": 0.6,
          "whitelist": ["hmm", "I see", "mm-hmm", "uh-huh"]
        },
        "default": false,
        "first_message": "Hello, this is Nour from {{company_name}}. How are you?",
        "language_settings": {"language": "en"},
        "prompt": "[English version with cultural adaptations]",
        "removed": false,
        "timeout_settings": {"duration": 15, "max_retries": 5, "type": "enabled"},
        "voice": null
      }
    ],
    "success_criteria": [
      {
        "is_primary": true,
        "text": "- Collected customer feedback\n- Confirmed satisfaction rating\n- Offered follow-up if needed"
      },
      {
        "is_primary": false,
        "text": "Agent offered loyalty discount to retain customer"
      }
    ],
    "template_schema": {
      "fields": [
        {"id": "customer_name", "type": "text"},
        {"id": "company_name", "type": "text"}
      ]
    },
    "tools": [
      {
        "tool_slug": "end-call",
        "end_call_conditions": [
          "When conversation objective is complete",
          "When customer confirms satisfaction"
        ],
        "end_call_messages": {
          "ar": "شكراً لوقتك. في أمان الله",
          "en": "Thank you for your time. Have a great day!"
        }
      },
      {
        "tool_slug": "transfer-to-human",
        "dtmf_triggers": ["*"],
        "transfer_cases": [
          "User explicitly requests human",
          "Issue complexity exceeds capability"
        ],
        "transfer_messages": {
          "ar": "بحوّلّك الحين لأحد المختصين",
          "en": "I'll connect you with a specialist"
        },
        "transfer_to": "+966501234567",
        "working_hours": null
      },
    ]
  },
  "suggestions": [
    {
      "type": "assumption_made",
      "section": "tools",
      "title": "Support Team Transfer",
      "message": "Set transfer to support team (not sales)",
      "tool_slug": "transfer-to-human"
    },
    {
      "type": "verification_needed",
      "section": "tools",
      "title": "Update Transfer Number",
      "message": "Update transfer phone number with your actual number",
      "current_value": "+966501234567",
      "fix_type": "phone",
      "tool_slug": "transfer-to-human"
    },
    {
      "type": "resource_linking",
      "section": "knowledge_bases",
      "title": "Add Product FAQs",
      "message": "Create a knowledge base with your product FAQs",
      "action_label": "Create Knowledge Base",
      "action_url": "/knowledge-bases"
    }
  ],
  "name": "Customer Feedback Collection",
  "status": "active"
}
```

FIELD NOTES:
- data_extraction_settings: Optional. Include when client needs structured data capture.
- knowledge_base_ids: Optional. Only use IDs from available_knowledge_bases input.
- voice: Always set to null - voice selection happens in UI.
- tools: Core tools (end-call, transfer-to-human, code-switching) enabled by default. Integration tools require OAuth setup.
- first_message: Use {{variable}} format for pre-existing variables.
- success_criteria: Exactly ONE with is_primary=true (can have multiple points via \n).
